[{"title":"䱐溪吟赠归愚子","author":"周永铨","text":"䱐溪浮水清且涟，䱐溪水与吴淞连。\n吴淞片帆挂云树，直到䱐溪屋边住。\n君家在溪侧，我家在江边。\n溪光江色两潇洒，往往相思乘钓船。\n自从我卜城东宅，送君翻作朱方客。\n君去几开溪畔花，君归还卧溪边石。\n我来访君溪上行，溪水迎人如有情。\n门前问字多俊英，堂上论文皆老成。\n高斋学士定谁属，被褐先生方自名。\n只今五十斗未白，闭户著书声籍籍。\n生徒自重沈云祯，时俗那知王彦伯。\n愧我与子称莫逆，濩落相看感今昔。\n空怜早岁误儒冠，徒尔穷年抱遗册。\n君不见鱄䱐门外水绕村，田居蚕室好称尊。\n与君一咏《沧浪曲》，世事悠悠何足论！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29538,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"关山月","author":"周永铨","text":"一片关山接塞天，愁看白月迥临边。\n寒侵古戍秦城远，晕逐连营汉阵圆。\n少妇楼头鸾镜合，将军账外玉弓悬。\n金波尽入征人泪，回照乡园路十千。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29539,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"京口闻雁","author":"周永铨","text":"楚雨迷红树，吴霜老白蘋。\n一声京口雁，愁杀渡江人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29540,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟唐人边庭四时怨 其一","author":"周永铨","text":"望断阳和到雪山，故园花月楚刀环。\n汉家雨露提封外，春色遥应度玉关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29541,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟唐人边庭四时怨 其二","author":"周永铨","text":"草生边地夏初回，暑雨刀耕白漠开。\n愁杀赤亭飞鸟断，行人何事火山来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29542,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟唐人边庭四时怨 其三","author":"周永铨","text":"昨夜西风入戍楼，前军移帐急防秋。\n阴山猎火龙沙月，同照征夫出塞愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29543,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟唐人边庭四时怨 其四","author":"周永铨","text":"万堡云迷朔气凝，雪深马足失超腾。\n浑脱终岁防飞渡，况复黄河十月冰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29544,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"捣衣曲","author":"周永铨","text":"一夕凉生秦女机，砧声不待雁南飞。\n谁知万里黄云戍，已有新霜上铁衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29545,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿灵隐寺梵香阁晓起眺望","author":"周准","text":"晚从冷泉游，遂止招提境。\n入门闻清钟，孤阁夜方永。\n倾耳听泉声，声喧意弥静。\n朝来小雨过，宿雾散高岭。\n凭窗见层峰，涧壑殊清迥。\n不知晓云过，但觉衣裳冷。\n清飙动林薄，初日照山影。\n行当访韬光，直上松云顶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29546,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得古别离送郑子","author":"周准","text":"劲羽乏群栖，转蓬靡暂息。\n伊人贫困士，能无去乡国。\n辞乡阻长川，旅迹殊可怜。\n昨别俄六载，斯游定几年。\n游踪渺无畔，淮水连河岸。\n回瞻云树深，忽忽兴长叹。\n云外指京畿，秋风冷客衣。\n可堪闻塞雁，正值向南飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29547,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"缘天都峰趾度云巢洞上升仙梯遂憩文殊院","author":"周准","text":"天都信岧峣，特立若翠屏。\n取径过其趾，俯仰皆奥境。\n松石俱象形，岩峦类盘绠。\n将陟目屡眩，恐坠心更警。\n行经阴洞中，恍惚陷深井。\n须臾从井出，冉冉首露顶。\n䁹盼多创遘，不类人世景。\n境断缘梯升，气逼毛骨冷。\n意坚斯有获，出险真自幸。\n向晚憩禅扉，一灯照孤影。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29548,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"壮士行","author":"周准","text":"请为壮士行，用识壮士情。\n壮士重恩轻死生。\n主人临歧，陈设饮宴。\n悲歌声彻，客容尽变。\n酒阑日落云天高，远闻凄风起于旷野，猛虎啸于林皋。\n风鸣虎啸扬鞭走，去去报仇不回首。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29549,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明妃曲","author":"周准","text":"中原消息断，胡地风沙寒。\n经年不逢春，凄恻摧心肝。\n君王遣妾和戎虏，万晨辞家心独苦。\n早知塞处不胜愁，那怪将军怕边士。\n君不见百战生降李少卿，羁留绝域一身轻。\n丈夫失路尚如此，贱妾含悲空复情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29550,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀旧","author":"周准","text":"自失鸳湖叟，诗盟三载寒。\n已知生死断，犹乍别离看。\n老去悲丘井，情来望逝湍。\n还闻淮水畔，禅宇托空棺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29551,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晨自松陵归渡太湖即事","author":"周准","text":"回望垂虹隔杳冥，湖波浩渺快扬舲。\n半篙日气雾中白，万点浪花烟外青。\n隐隐榜歌来雁汊，凄凄渔笛出云汀。\n还怜心切乡闾近，未暇携筇访洞庭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29552,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戍妇吟","author":"周准","text":"凄凄贱妾闭兰堂，渺渺征人戍朔方。\n漫拟龙城罢行役，空怜燕阁阅年芳。\n分弓营畔沙如雪，挂镜台前月似霜。\n绝域荷戈音信杳，几回清泪湿流黄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29553,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题秦馀女史所画楚辞图","author":"周准","text":"绕堂烟浪洞庭深，芳杜幽兰遍水浔。\n北渚已传湘女恨，南征更识楚臣心。\n云中桂棹声疑咽，天际瑶台影乍沉。\n写尽《离骚》无限意，《竹枝》歌罢又猿吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29554,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江上曲","author":"周准","text":"空江潮落水茫茫，南楚征途万里长。\n为是曾经分手地，不听离曲亦神伤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29555,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞下曲","author":"周准","text":"持筹绝域感蹉跎，沙塞年年漫枕戈。\n翻羡苏卿归国早，白头终向茂陵过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29556,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蝴蝶词","author":"周准","text":"万花谷里逐芳尘，自爱翩跹粉泽新。\n多少繁华任留恋，不知只是梦中身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29557,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"汉川","author":"周准","text":"汉川城郭枕江堤，黯黯烟波日乍低。\n我欲停桡访神女，暮山无际楚云西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29558,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"履霜操","author":"盛锦","text":"霜皑皑兮泸之浒，儿弗履兮，畏我父母。\n儿身载寒兮，儿心载苦。\n儿心兮父心，儿身兮母身。\n寒兮苦兮，实伤我亲。\n儿罪兮莫逭，亲心兮可转。\n俟日出而回光兮，履霜亦暧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29559,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十二碚","author":"盛锦","text":"群峰束奔流，虎牙怒相向。\n对峙十二碚，罗列钟鼓状。\n颠崖矗层霄，旁窦穿激浪。\n峡泉落九夭，汹汹翻海藏。\n撑舟出井底，篙师气先丧。\n众工捷如猱，百丈缘壁上。\n木末纵飞腾，山凹迭升降。\n一鼓更作气，千篙力谁让。\n造化何神奇，设此待霸王。\n颇闻白帝子，于此拒汉将。\n铁锁贯浮梁，金戈森卫仗。\n萧铣复何人，屯兵倚叠嶂。\n群雄电扫空，故垒犹在望。\n平生历险艰，未若兹游壮。\n万里投蛮荒，一身堕烟瘴。\n风餐案倾欹，水宿魂震荡。\n搜奇命转轻，得句神益旺。\n讵畏前途修，瞿塘险如象。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29560,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"空舲峡","author":"盛锦","text":"出峡复入峡，两崖插青冥。\n中流逐狂飙，奔腾万马声。\n下滩梭一掷，触石危樯倾。\n逆挽劳百夫，十步九倒行。\n力尽听所止，刺篙就回汀。\n爱此民居壮，凌空驾轩楹。\n宿云出洞户，古木撑岩屏。\n惊猿或挂树，怪鸟时一鸣。\n扪萝上绝壁，山风动冠缨。\n呼童拾锦石，信手扳杂英。\n兴幽忘涉险，角目多怡情。\n前途苦逼仄，绝境难久停。\n过午岩日晦，磊落见数星。\n厓黑畏突虎，蛮语频丁宁。\n移舟近湍激，拍枕声铿鍧。\n骨肉缘久断，中肖梦亦清。\n狂吟出险句，那顾邻舟惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29561,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"峡夜","author":"盛锦","text":"噭噭猿啼夜，凄凄鹤唳空。\n断厓开四壁，深井落孤篷。\n树漏暂明月，湍惊无定风。\n万重云水隔，归梦亦途穷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29562,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎牙滩","author":"盛锦","text":"楚蜀分争地，雄关扼怒涛。\n滩声牛峡转，山势虎牙高。\n岩树丹青杂，舟樯下上劳。\n新诗横槊赋，旅兴一时豪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29563,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓发","author":"盛锦","text":"晓发东安道，轻霜净马蹄。\n乱鸦僧阁外，残月女墙西。\n春冷花犹敛，沙平路欲迷。\n东皋待时雨，取次把锄犁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29564,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"老将","author":"盛锦","text":"白发枕戈眠，黄沙带甲穿。\n风云经百战，筋力尽三边。\n旧识飞狐路，高谈射虎年。\n闻笳心未死，尚想勒燕然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29565,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登白帝城","author":"盛锦","text":"万仞墙临滟滪堆，子阳霸业划江开。\n白盐峰对城头出，巫峡帆从地底来。\n云起化龙迷故井，风生跃马有高台。\n汉家陵阙同灰灭，泪尽寒猿日夕哀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29566,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白帝诚谒昭烈武侯庙","author":"盛锦","text":"永安宫殿峡江头，一体君臣祀武侯。\n天祖式临传诏夜，风云色变出师秋。\n鸣銮久绝空山道，筹笔犹悬古驿楼。\n瞻尚死忠谌死孝，千秋配食重诒谋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29567,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟抵泸州","author":"盛锦","text":"锦江直下古城壕，地入炎荒近不毛。\n万里亲朋劳梦寐，十旬餐宿托风涛。\n征蛮罗甸军声远，《谕蜀》文园典策高。\n扫尽瘴烟开郡阁，岷峨天半落挥毫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29568,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"任城使院晤翁霁堂有赠","author":"盛锦","text":"并马长安忆旧游，逢君意气振高秋。\n酒徒半散荆卿市，词垒孤悬李白楼。\n握手星辰摇短剑，离心风雨送扁舟。\n明年醉我南池上，须典千金紫绮裘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29569,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题杜文贞公南池新祠","author":"盛锦","text":"浣花游迹寄南池，洗马鸣蝉感昔时。\n遇主名高《三礼赋》，怀人心折《八哀》诗。\n铸同贾岛应呼佛，绣比平原合买丝。\n玉貌仰瞻如旧识，忆曾亲拜草堂祠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29570,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白莲","author":"盛锦","text":"玉井分栽到野塘，冰绡翠袖迥生凉。\n半江残月欲无影，一岸冷云何处香。\n真相尚留开土社，红衣尽洗美人妆。\n《水仙操》罢扁舟去，谁与凌波解佩珰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29571,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别兄弟","author":"盛锦","text":"未斟别酒已伤神，四海终输同气亲。\n此去白云天万里，望归无复倚闾人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29572,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别家人","author":"盛锦","text":"伏雌烹罢劝加餐，秉烛喃喃语放阑。\n点检箧中裘葛具，预知别后寄衣难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29573,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"入蜀怀沈湘凫","author":"盛锦","text":"双溪对掩古溪边，妇汲儿舂各可怜。\n浩浩乾坤两萍叶，计程我更远三千。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29574,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"芦花","author":"汪俊","text":"尔本无情者，缘何亦白头。\n丹枫同瑟瑟，野水并悠悠。\n霜冷下宵雁，月明来钓舟。\n相逢秋雪里，老我不胜愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29575,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭少宗伯春晖姊丈二首 其一","author":"汪俊","text":"老去身家不两存，俄看霜后萎芳荪。\n燕巢华屋垂新泪，马鬣空山感旧恩。\n岂意十年重一面，却来千里与招魂。\n茑萝虽附潘杨未，未敢同声哭寝门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29576,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭少宗伯春晖姊丈二首 其二","author":"汪俊","text":"谁知小别意千年，梦幻韵华逐逝川。\n我尚拖泥兼带水，君非成佛定生天。\n从前似历华严劫，向后休参文字禅。\n昨自黄公垆下过，一声邻笛欲潸然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29577,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"袁墓","author":"汪俊","text":"香云漠漠雪飘飘，积翠层岚近可招。\n犹记玉堂春夜梦，短篷斜系虎山桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29578,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元宵忆家","author":"汪俊","text":"大地冰轮原普照，故园想亦共清光。\n别离人度团圆夜，白发红颜各断肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29579,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏蝉","author":"朱受新","text":"抱叶隐深林，乘时嘒嘒吟。\n如何忘远举，饮露已清心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29580,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"独处怨","author":"朱受新","text":"月中自顾娉婷影，镜里谁怜憔悴容。\n永夜制衣金剪冷，秋风万里度卢龙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29581,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"流萤词","author":"朱受新","text":"暗飞几点隔帘栊，影乱繁星度远空。\n莫入班姬金阁里，恐随团扇落秋风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29582,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吴官词","author":"朱受新","text":"夜拥笙歌百尽台，太湖月落宴还开。\n君王自爱倾城色，却忘人从敌国来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29583,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春莺曲","author":"朱受新","text":"千门春静落红香，宛转莺声隐绿杨。\n任尔楼头啼晓雨，美人梦已到渔阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29584,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明河曲","author":"朱受新","text":"清秋泻影画楼前，一水盈盈耿碧天。\n若果此中风浪静，女牛何事别经年？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29585,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白秋海棠","author":"朱受新","text":"清秋湛露浥琼芳，素影风摇玉砌旁。\n夜静看花人独立，水晶帘外月如霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29586,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日归泊阊门","author":"楼锜","text":"年年踪迹感漂蓬，冷落柴门烟雨中。\n燕子归来迷旧垒，桃花何处笑春风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29587,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上陈见复先生","author":"王大椿","text":"读书不求名位高，饮酒不尽千钟醪。\n得心每在淡与泊，此中至乐诚陶陶。\n先生闭户穴《坟》《典》，卅年门径丛蓬蒿。\n三公令仆断梦寐，淡如云影径鸿毛。\n忽传不诏贲郡邑，水南水北纷喧嚣。\n公卿合辞拜手荐，汉廷经术千秋遭。\n申辕年已惫筋力，蒲轮难涉风尘劳。\n上陈著述达黼座，至尊下遣官胥钞。\n周情孔思审中正，辨别白黑穷厘毫。\n少司成职重太学，帝命取式风之浇。\n先生受官不受禄，几席讲学仍衡茅。\n走也仰钻希万一，有似蚁垤窥潐峣。\n韩门近在许偻入，欲抉精髓弃粕糟。\n寸莛巨杵叩俱应，试听鐄鐄天半鸣蒲牢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29588,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上巳忆白下","author":"李葂","text":"清明恰是握兰辰，遥卜秦淮景物新。\n杨柳晚风深巷酒，桃花春水隔帘人。\n桥边车过香生路，楼外船归月满津。\n憔悴不堪来旧馆，相逢谁为浣沙尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29589,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题雅雨师借书图","author":"李葂","text":"旋假旋归未得闲，十行俱下片时间。\n百城深入便便腹，直抵荆州借不还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29590,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过废园","author":"李葂","text":"谁家亭院自成春，窗有莓苔案有尘。\n偏是关心邻舍犬，隔墙犹吠折花人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29591,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"徐俟斋祠","author":"潘廷埙","text":"羊肠岭畔幽栖处，一水当门泻作渠。\n薇蕨西山心自印，藻蘋南涧奠还虚。\n相忘桑海逃名后，不接贤豪俟命馀。\n此日行人罕凭吊，烟云惟护逸民庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29592,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 南梁","author":"吴氏","text":"同泰一人归佛地，寿阳千骑渡江波。\n盟成自取金瓯缺，蔬绝空陈鸡子多。\n五月谁勤君父难，七官先反弟兄戈。\n江淮废后襄阳促，秋草台城放橐驼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29593,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山阴道中三首 其三","author":"王慧","text":"溪流绕巉岩，一苇去不息。\n沙濑清且浅，水底见竹色。\n文石无岁年，山根浸历历。\n谷鸟鸣转幽，溯洄安所极。\n水花爱明净，绝境杳难即。\n可有浣纱人，一笑似相识。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29594,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"芝塘候潮因忆亡友","author":"王慧","text":"水浅舟胶日半斜，扣舷闲望似天涯。\n烟深竹坞鸠呼雨，潮落芦根蟹聚沙。\n愁绪萦缠同蔓草，年华衰谢感残花。\n剧怜弱女常同泊，相对蓬窗数晚鸦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29595,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"琐窗杂事二首 其一","author":"宠畹","text":"夫婿长贫老岁华，生憎名字满天涯。\n席门却有闲车马，自拔金钗付酒家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29596,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"琐窗杂事二首 其二","author":"宠畹","text":"春雨春寒过落梅，连宵不禁晚风催。\n闲园收拾残花片，供得儿曹靧面来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29597,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送夫子之鸠江","author":"范淑钟","text":"征鞍落叶打离披，忍泪临风饯一卮。\n夕照渐低人渐远，断鸿声里立多时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29598,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虞姬","author":"吴永和","text":"大王真英雄，姬亦奇女子。\n惜哉太史公，不纪美人死。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29599,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠外子玉苍北上","author":"吴永和","text":"挟策长安去，谁怜行路难。\n恐伤游子意，别泪不轻弹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29600,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"家居","author":"丁瑜","text":"木石风花结四邻，寂寥门巷久无人。\n昔年燕子今重到，始信交情尔独真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29601,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西颢","author":"张令仪","text":"大火既流，凉风荐爽。\n四时代谢，成功者往。\n是刈是获，东作乃登。\n馨香玉粒，神享其烝。\n率我妇子，中夜鸣机。\n凉霜戒晨，勿使无衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29602,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"张令仪","text":"天将降阴雨，病骨必先痛。\n转辗不能寐，常至霜钟动。\n老觉近年增，愁自三生种。\n万虑积此时，疾苦非所重。\n逝者日以久，忧来谁与共。\n一岁又将除，五穷复难送。\n翻羡长眠人，不醒钧天梦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29603,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]